  "historyNote": "#2069, eff 7-1-82; ss by #2733, eff 5-31-84, EXPIRED: 5-31-90 New. #5213, eff 8-28-91, EXPIRED: 8-28-97 New. #8487, eff 11-17-05; ss by #8980, eff 9-20-07",
